              "id": "CVE-2025-37731",
              "shortDescription": {
                 "text": "high severity - CVE-2025-37731 Improper Authentication vulnerability in pkg:maven\/co.elastic.clients\/elasticsearch-java@8.12.0"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Improper Authentication in Elasticsearch PKI realm can lead to user impersonation via specially crafted client certificates. A malicious actor would need to have such a crafted client certificate signed by a legitimate, trusted Certificate Authority."
