              "id": "CVE-2026-65913",
              "shortDescription": {
                 "text": "medium severity - CVE-2026-65913 vulnerability in pkg:javascript\/DOMPurify@3.1.6"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "When USE_PROFILES is enabled, DOMPurify rebuilds ALLOWED_ATTR as a plain array whose properties are looked up by name, making it susceptible to prototype pollution. If Array.prototype has been polluted with an event handler attribute name (e.g. onclick), DOMPurify will allow that event handler to survive sanitization, resulting in DOM-based XSS."
              },
              "help": {
