          "ruleId": "CVE-2026-42585",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "CVE-2026-42585 - Netty is an asynchronous, event-driven network application framework. Prior to 4.2.13.Final and 4.1.133.Final, Netty incorrectly parses malformed Transfer-Encoding, enabling request smuggling attacks. This vulnerability is fixed in 4.2.13.Final and 4.1.133.Final."
          },
